{"4199230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clean Memories", "steam_appid": 4199230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every place holds memories. Every stain hides a memory.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside the reconstructed memories of Julian's life and bring forgotten places back to their former state. <strong>Clean, restore, and organize</strong> each environment as you uncover the details hidden beneath years of neglect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/extras/c749a2d15702a85726d975f849928510.poster.avif?t=1787821106\" aria-label=\"Clean, restore and organize\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/extras/c749a2d15702a85726d975f849928510.webm?t=1787821106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/extras/c749a2d15702a85726d975f849928510.mp4?t=1787821106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But these are not ordinary places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Julian is a brilliant scientist and the creator of <strong>M.A.I.D. (Memory Archive Immersion Device)</strong>, a machine capable of recreating past experiences. Memories, however, are never perfect. Forgotten details and blurred emotions manifest within M.A.I.D. as dirt, clutter, damage, and disorder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more faithfully you restore a memory, the clearer it becomes. <strong>Clean forgotten spaces, discover hidden objects and memories, and uncover the stories they hold.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/extras/41a3f303e16085d3fa6f322255bdee51.poster.avif?t=1787821106\" aria-label=\"Discover hidden memories\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/extras/41a3f303e16085d3fa6f322255bdee51.webm?t=1787821106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/extras/41a3f303e16085d3fa6f322255bdee51.mp4?t=1787821106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of success, Julian finds himself alone, consumed by loneliness and regret. His greatest achievement came at the cost of the people he loved. Now, he enters M.A.I.D. to revisit the few happy memories he has left—and confront the painful truths he has spent years avoiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore memories. Rediscover the past. Uncover the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing first-person cleaning and restoration gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean, repair, and organize</strong> detailed environments from different stages of Julian's life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore reconstructed memories</strong> and uncover hidden details and forgotten objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover optional memory notebooks</strong> and piece together more of Julian's past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a heartfelt narrative</strong> about family, friendship, regret, and reconciliation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch each environment transform</strong> from disorder and decay into clarity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover multiple endings</strong> based on how completely you restore and uncover each memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique locations filled with personal stories and meaningful objects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/extras/ea9a3bc82b1bfe5a4a4324dd9d494f27.avif?t=1787821106\" alt=\"\"width=200 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every place holds memories. Every stain hides a memory.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside the reconstructed memories of Julian's life and bring forgotten places back to their former state. <strong>Clean, restore, and organize</strong> each environment as you uncover the details hidden beneath years of neglect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/extras/c749a2d15702a85726d975f849928510.poster.avif?t=1787821106\" aria-label=\"Clean, restore and organize\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/extras/c749a2d15702a85726d975f849928510.webm?t=1787821106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/extras/c749a2d15702a85726d975f849928510.mp4?t=1787821106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But these are not ordinary places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Julian is a brilliant scientist and the creator of <strong>M.A.I.D. (Memory Archive Immersion Device)</strong>, a machine capable of recreating past experiences. Memories, however, are never perfect. Forgotten details and blurred emotions manifest within M.A.I.D. as dirt, clutter, damage, and disorder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more faithfully you restore a memory, the clearer it becom