b_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch each environment transform</strong> from disorder and decay into clarity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover multiple endings</strong> based on how completely you restore and uncover each memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique locations filled with personal stories and meaningful objects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/extras/ea9a3bc82b1bfe5a4a4324dd9d494f27.avif?t=1787821106\" alt=\"\"width=200 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Clean, repair, and organize forgotten spaces. Uncover the memories hidden beneath the dirt in this relaxing first-person cleaning adventure.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/b0f7f9650d5ed40f0e75d0d31532b83f37df37e1/header.jpg?t=1787821106", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/403c40cc8920d861e730b01d3733346fb9a0c559/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787821106", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199230/403c40cc8920d861e730b01d3733346fb9a0c559/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787821106", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-7500 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-10600 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Gra